span></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"input","cn":"输入框","en":"Input","desc":"用户打字的地方，和普通输入框一样","desc_en":"The same type of field users type into for ordinary input"},{"key":"panel","cn":"建议面板","en":"Suggestion Panel","desc":"跟随输入实时刷新候选","desc_en":"Updates suggestions as the user types"},{"key":"item","cn":"建议项","en":"Suggestion","desc":"一条候选，键盘上下可选","desc_en":"One suggestion; users can move through suggestions with the keyboard"},{"key":"match","cn":"高亮片段","en":"Matched Text","desc":"命中的关键词加亮，说明为什么推荐它","desc_en":"Highlights matching keywords to show why the suggestion appears."}]},"variants":[{"cn":"搜索联想","en":"Search Suggest","demo":"<div class=\"ac-wrap\" style=\"width:210px\"><input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"vibe\"><div class=\"ac-panel\"><span class=\"ac-item on\"><b>vibe</b> coding 入门</span><span class=\"ac-item\"><b>vibe</b>-ui-guide</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"ac-wrap\" style=\"width:210px\"><input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"vibe\"><div class=\"ac-panel\"><span class=\"ac-item on\"><b>vibe</b> Getting started with coding</span><span class=\"ac-item\"><b>vibe</b>-ui-guide</span></div></div>","when":"搜索框里边打字边给候选词","when_en":"Type candidate words in the search box"},{"cn":"邮箱后缀","en":"Email Suffix","demo":"<div class=\"ac-wrap\" style=\"width:210px\"><input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"oil-oil@\"><div class=\"ac-panel\"><span class=\"ac-item on\">oil-oil@<b>gmail.com</b></span><span class=\"ac-item\">oil-oil@<b>qq.com</b></span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"ac-wrap\" style=\"width:210px\"><input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"alex.chen@\"><div class=\"ac-panel\"><span class=\"ac-item on\">alex.chen@<b>gmail.com</b></span><span class=\"ac-item\">alex.chen@<b>qq.com</b></span></div></div>","when":"邮箱、网址这类半固定格式的输入","when_en":"Semi-fixed format input such as email and URL"},{"cn":"历史记录","en":"History","demo":"<div class=\"ac-wrap\" style=\"width:210px\"><input class=\"demo-input\" placeholder=\"搜索组件…\"><div class=\"ac-panel\"><span class=\"ac-item\">🕘 日期选择器</span><span class=\"ac-item\">🕘 表单校验</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"ac-wrap\" style=\"width:210px\"><input class=\"demo-input\" placeholder=\"Search component...\"><div class=\"ac-panel\"><span class=\"ac-item\">🕘 date picker</span><span class=\"ac-item\">🕘 form validation</span></div></div>","when":"让用户一次点击重选最近搜过的内容","when_en":"Allow users to reselect recently searched content with one click"},{"cn":"分组建议","en":"Grouped","demo":"<div class=\"ac-wrap\" style=\"width:210px\"><input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"按钮\"><div class=\"ac-panel\"><span class=\"ac-group\">组件</span><span class=\"ac-item on\"><b>按钮</b> Button</span><span class=\"ac-group\">文档</span><span class=\"ac-item\"><b>按钮</b>设计规范</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"ac-wrap\" style=\"width:210px\"><input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"Button\"><div class=\"ac-panel\"><span class=\"ac-group\">Component</span><span class=\"ac-item on\"><b>Button</b></span><span class=\"ac-group\">Documentation</span><span class=\"ac-item\"><b>Button</b> design guidelines</span></div></div>","when":"候选来自不同类型时，按类型分组以便识别","when_en":"When candidates are from different types, group them by type for easier identification"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>搜索框联想</b>：输入关键词，实时给出候选","m":"ac-suggest"},{"t":"<b>固定后缀补全</b>：邮箱、网址这类「半自由」输入；提交时仍按业务规则校验","m":"ac-email"},{"t":"<b>历史记录快速重选</b>：最近搜过、用过的直接点","m":"ac-history"},{"t":"<b>命令面板</b>：输入指令名快速执行操作","m":"ac-command"}],"dont":[{"t":"<b>选项是固定枚举</b>：使用 {c:select}，或限制组合框只能选择建议","m":"sel-list"},{"t":"<b>数据有层级关系</b>：使用 {c:cascader} 逐级选择","m":"sel-cascader"},{"t":"<b>选项较少且需要直接比较</b>：使用 {c:radio} 平铺展示","m":"sel-radio"},{"t":"<b>业务只接受已有数据</b>，却允许未匹配内容提交","m":"ac-mismatch","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"公司有几千名员工。邀请“王小明”时，怎样帮助用户找对人？","options":[{"id":"autocomplete","label":"输入名字后显示匹配的人，选中一位再邀请","feedback":"对。候选集很大且已有规范数据时，自动完成能帮助搜索并避免拼错。","correct":true},{"id":"long-select","label":"打开普通下拉框，再按姓名首字母缩小几千人的列表","feedback":"大量选项难以浏览，也不适合按名字快速缩小范围。","correct":false},{"id":"new-text","label":"输入完整姓名后，直接邀请搜索结果里的第一位同名员工","feedback":"同名员工可能不止一位。系统应展示部门、邮箱等可区分信息，让用户明确选中目标，而不是替用户猜。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"To invite Wang Xiaoming among thousands of employees, which interaction fits?","options":[{"id":"autocomplete","label":"Offer matching suggestions after typing, then select an existing employee","feedback":"Correct. With a large, standardized candidate set, autocomplete supports search and avoids misspelling.","correct":true},{"id":"long-select","label":"Put every employee in one long Select","feedback":"Large option sets are hard to browse and not fast to narrow by name.","correct":false},{"id":"new-text","label":"Accept arbitrary text and create a new employee with that name","feedback":"The invitee must match an existing account; arbitrary creation makes duplicates or wrong targets.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"成员邀请框请在输入至少两个字符后查询匹配员工，选择建议项后再发送邀请。测试无结果、同名候选和键盘选择：无结果要说明原因，同名项要有可区分信息，选中后提交的必须是员工 id。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"For member invite, query matching employees after at least two characters and send the invite only after a suggestion is selected. Test no result, same-name candidates, and keyboard selection: explain no result, distinguish duplicate names, and submit an employee id after selection."}},"references":[{"title":"Combobox 组合框模式","source":"WAI-ARIA APG","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/combobox/","title_en":"Combobox Pattern"}],"scenes":["全局搜索框","登录邮箱输入","地址联想","命令面板"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Address entry","m":"ac-suggest"},{"t":"Contact lookup","m":"ac-email"},{"t":"Tag suggestions","m":"ac-history"},{"t":"Search with likely matches","m":"ac-command"}],"dont":[{"t":"Force a suggestion when free text should remain valid","m":"sel-list"},{"t":"Show unrelated results before enough text is entered","m":"sel-cascader"},{"t":"Change the typed value without clear confirmation","m":"sel-radio"},{"t":"Use it for a tiny fixed list","m":"ac-mismatch","bad":true}],"scenes":["Address form","Mention a teammate","Tag editor","Search box"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--brand)\">VibeHub</b>\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px\" value=\"button\">\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;font-size:13px\">🔔</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ac-panel\">\n        <span class=\"ac-item on\"><b>Button</b> · Component</span>\n        <span class=\"ac-item\"><b>Button</b> guidelines · Documentation</span>\n        <span class=\"ac-item\">Radio <b>button</b> · Component</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:300px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">Log in to your account</div>\n      <div class=\"ac-wrap\" style=\"width:100%\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"maya-lee@\">\n        <div class=\"ac-panel\">\n          <span class=\"ac-item on\">maya-lee@<b>gmail.com</b></span>\n          <span class=\"ac-item\">maya-lee@<b>qq.com</b></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:5px\">Shipping address</div>\n      <div class=\"ac-wrap\" style=\"width:100%\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"Nanshan\">\n        <div class=\"ac-panel\">\n          <span class=\"ac-item on\">Building R2-B, South Area, Science and Technology Park, <b>Nanshan</b> District, Shenzhen</span>\n          <span class=\"ac-item\">Zone C, Shekou Sea World, <b>Nanshan</b> District, Shenzhen</span>\n          <span class=\"ac-item\">No. 12, <b>Nanshan</b> Street, Guangzhou</span