k-opt on\">进行中</span><span class=\"mk-opt \">已完成</span><span class=\"mk-opt \">已过期</span></div></div>","sel-cascader":"<div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-select\">省 / 市 / 区<i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span><span class=\"mk-casc\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">广东省</span><span class=\"mk-opt on\">深圳市</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">南山区</span></span></div>","sel-radio":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio on\"></i>全部</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>进行中</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>已完成</span></div></div>","ac-mismatch":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">城市</span><span class=\"mk-input\">深圳s</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">错误值仍能提交，会影响后续统计</span></div>"}}}